/T (This solution transforms the Instamart homepage into a fully AI-personalized experience. Instead of showing the same interface to every user, the homepage dynamically adapts based on food orders, grocery purchases, dineout activity, gifting behavior, seasonal events, and browsing history. The AI predicts what users are most likely to need and prioritises those products, categories, and offers.)
/E (This solution transforms the Instamart homepage into a fully AI-personalized experience. Instead of showing the same interface to every user, the homepage dynamically adapts based on food orders, grocery purchases, dineout activity, gifting behavior, seasonal events, and browsing history. The AI predicts what users are most likely to need and prioritises those products, categories, and offers.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10]
>>
